{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"Noah is a type of player. He is a minmaxer that loves to uses the tools in his pocket to make an advantage within the rules. Sometimes he looks at the rules and his internal story about his plans, and his exploits as the part of the story he is most interested. And as the server rules state, everyone is entitled to a satisfying  arch and to have their voice heard. The rules also talk about how a sour note resonates through the whole server, and how the world that they are building in is a person too.","created_at":"2021-07-16T23:50:59.482000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865742343822376970","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
