{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"The 25% 75% percent rule is my way of begging the community to understand that this is not dominion level play. That we have to have some linear rails. That we are telling a story and that story sometimes means that despite their exploits and tricks, the game must move forward and can't always swing to adjust for players who can out wit us? I'm absolutely not as good at this game as some of my players. Noah, devon, ethan. But just \nBecause, I might not be able to out wit them on the fly, should major game play plans be scrapped on the fly?","created_at":"2021-07-16T23:59:18.232000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-16T23:59:53.170000Z","id":"865744435732283392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
