{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"But it can't ever be real dnd. The expectations are something I have tried to address. I poured my heart into the server rules. And I don't know how to commicate it better? We might be bumping up against my autism here.","created_at":"2021-07-17T00:05:59.604000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865746119207026715","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
