{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"859862265125666866","content":"So, I have rejection sensitivity disphoria. Should I have had such strong feels about noah and grey bouncing to get some space after a confusing moment? Probably not. The idea of those two having issues with me hits my autonomic system. Fight or flight are not the only parts of autonomic reactions. My reaction is to freeze. The reactions come when there is a perceived danger. In this case, the danger was that if Noah and grey were up set with my dming again, the things that went poorly last year will happen again this year. It makes my anxiety peak . But only for a little bit. I stress hard, and I move on. Having this chat to talk about it helps. It helps the players not see my brain chemistry going haywire. Please excuse Heki too. He and Ian (tao) have an instinct to protect me when I am scared. They are wonderful friends. And we might bitch about certain players at certain times. But I love noah. And I love devon. They have been with me forever.  What matters is that the game continue with as few of these speed bumps as I can. What you two mods did was perfect.  Thank you.","created_at":"2021-07-17T12:05:27.536000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-17T12:11:23.420000Z","id":"865927178638458901","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
